      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1964691147005284525",
      "text": "[2:59PM] #OkeOdo #trafficUpdate \n\nThe stretch from Ajegunle inward Alakuko, Kola, Meiran, and Ijaiye through to Abule Egba is experiencing free flow. Ascending Jubilee Bridge inward Super is also clear, though approaching Ile Epo is slightly slow due to market and bus stop activities. However, the onward journey towards Pleasure remains very good.\n\nOn the return journey, movement from Pleasure inward Ile Epo down to Super is flowing well. Similarly, ascending Jubilee Bridge from Super inward Abule Egba, through Awori, down to Ijaiye, Meiran, Kola, Alakuko, and Ajegunle is free of impediments.\n\nAt Oja Oba, beneath Jubilee Bridge where traffic lights regulate movement, the situation is calm and steady, extending down to Charity Junction. The connection from Charity Road down to Social Club inward Olayiwola is also clear, while movement towards and from Abattoir, including the return journey to Charity Junction, remains smooth.\nPersonnel are strategically positioned to monitor and maintain the traffic situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
