      "text": "[3:09PM] #LagosIsland #Olowu #TrafficUpdate \n\n Movement from Adekunle Intersection on Third Mainland Bridge inward Adeniji Adele Road and stretching down to Onikan Roundabout is good.\n\nThe Apongbon Bridge descent to outer Marina, inward CMS, and onward to the train station is also free and good to go. Similarly, traffic from NITEL Junction through State House inward McWen Bridge by Officers’ Mess, extending to Bonny Camp, is moving steadily.\n\nAscending Obalende Bridge inward Dolphin Intersection and through the Emergency Point inward Ilubirin, down to Carter Bridge exit linking back to Third Mainland Bridge inward Iyana Oworo, is experiencing good movement as well.\nNo impediments reported, and our officers are present at key locations ensuring ease of movement.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
