      "text": "RUN FREE, TIKTOK 🙏\n\n Bach Project PH mourned the death of rescued dog “Tiktok” from a car accident on Sunday, Sept. 7.\n\n“We don’t know how to put this into words. Today, we lost Tiktok in a tragic accident while she was in foster care,” the local animal welfare group said in a social media post.\n\nThe group reported that Tiktok slipped out, ran, and was hit by a car. “It was so sudden, and even now, it feels impossible to accept,” they added.\n\nREAD: https://t.co/32RepHBGJL",
